[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPARSE-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Complex sparse excitation and provider failure boundaries
STATEMENT: >>>
The solver seam shall accept finite complex excitation vectors and validate every provider response before combining or exposing it. Real-excitation compatibility may superpose two solves; direct complex providers shall support one factorization per requested system. Only explicit Unsupported may trigger a same-provider reference fallback; numerical, resource and transport failures shall propagate.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Derived campaign requirement. Implementation begins with src/linalg.rs and src/solver_contract.rs. Verification: tests/sparse_dynamic.rs legacy vector/shape/finite contracts. Native one-factor complex RHS and AC driver evidence are pending subsequent steps.
<<<
